        "action:n12"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "At the same time, complete the following steps: reserve funds for the purchase and send the purchase order to the supplier."
      ],
      "justification": "The concurrency timing word maps to the parallel guard label. Actions n9 and n12 redundantly but accurately cover the fund reservation and supplier dispatch instructions."
    },
    {
